{"about_the_game":"<strong>You've entered a world of liminality and nostalgia. The poolrooms evoke dreamlike feelings due to its serene blue water and clean tiles.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2>Poolcore is a first-person walking simulator traversing through dreamlike poolrooms. You have fallen into this world and now you must observe if these ancient waters and walls have sentient traits. Explore and solve puzzles to progress.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Photo-realistic graphics.<br></li><li>Large handcrafted levels.<br></li><li>Ethereal music.<br></li><li>Unique puzzles</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251780/extras/9135d1b2d234042903244646a15a01fe.poster.avif?t=1763050229\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251780/extras/9135d1b2d234042903244646a15a01fe.webm?t=1763050229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251780/extras/9135d1b2d234042903244646a15a01fe.mp4?t=1763050229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251780/extras/8931f428d36053232e5400d44d788cb4.poster.avif?t=1763050229\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251780/extras/8931f428d36053232e5400d44d788cb4.webm?t=1763050229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2251780/extras/8931f428d36053232e5400d44d788cb4.mp4?t=1763050229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgroun